<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine June inflation rises to 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine June inflation rises to 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine annualised consumer inflation rate rose to 4.8 percent in June from 4.2 percent in May, the National Statistics Office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	    June 97   May 97  June 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	+1.3     +0.0    +0.7</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change		+4.8     +4.2    +9.8</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     239.0    236.0   228.1</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (63 2) 810-9638 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
